Default value: null. The conv-rewrite-qwen-1.8b model is used.', example='conv-rewrite-qwen-1.8b'),
    }
  ](name='Rewrite', description='The multi-turn conversation rewriting configuration.', shrink='json', position='Query'),
  saveRetrieverHistory?: boolean(name='SaveRetrieverHistory', description='Specifies whether to save the historical text chunk recall test data. Valid values:
- true: Save.
- false: Do not save.

Default value: false.', example='false', position='Query'),
  searchFilters?: [ map[string]string ](name='SearchFilters', description='The personalized retrieval conditions, such as tags, configured by using SearchFilter to filter semantic retrieval results and exclude information irrelevant to the query.
The filtering logic takes effect when the is_displayed_chunk_content parameter is set to true. For more information, see [Knowledge base SearchFilters](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/2869641.html).', shrink='json', position='Query'),
  sparseSimilarityTopK?: int32(name='SparseSimilarityTopK', description='The top K value for keyword retrieval. The system retrieves chunks from the knowledge base that are an exact match for the keywords in the input text. This helps you filter out irrelevant text chunks and provides more accurate results.
Valid values: 0 to 100.
The sum of DenseSimilarityTopK and SparseSimilarityTopK must be less than or equal to 200.

Default value: 100.', example='100', position='Query'),
